      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحْصِفٌ</span></b>  A horse <i>that goes in the manner denoted
by the verb</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احصف</span>; (K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْصَفٌ</span></b>  (S,
K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْصَافٌ</span></b> ; (K;) [or] the last is applied
to a she-camel: (S:) the fem. of the first is with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>. (TA.)

